{"id":"j1fml3a0wpfjlz6xjnm978fu3","title":"城镇夜空飞过的人造卫星数量超过肉眼可见星星数量","originalTitle":null,"summary":"中纬度地区城镇上空夜晚任何时刻掠过的人造卫星数量超过 700 颗，远超肉眼可见的星星数量。研究显示，一个典型的英国城镇上空，夜晚任何时刻都有 710 颗卫星掠过，其中约 105 颗在掠过天顶时亮度足以媲美恒星。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"奇客 Solidot"},"links":{"original":"https://www.solidot.org/story?sid=85935"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T14:27:21.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T15:08:45.183Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T15:08:45.183Z","category":null,"tags":["研究成果"],"score":38,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"53a0e7cb-bbb9-4f8e-9185-37ccb2eb040b","title":"城镇夜空人造卫星数量首次超过肉眼可见星星数量"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"53a0e7cb-bbb9-4f8e-9185-37ccb2eb040b","title":"城镇夜空人造卫星数量首次超过肉眼可见星星数量"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fGhzrL_Euhog","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}